{"id":"ce7850ab3516c1cc","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-Z2.md","title":"Full Second Order Arithmetic","display":"df-Z2 — Full Second Order Arithmetic","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-Z2","aliases":["62-df-Z2"],"display":"df-Z2 — Full Second Order Arithmetic","depends_on":["[[62-df-basic-axioms]]","[[62-df-set-induction]]","[[62-df-Comprehension]]","[[62-df-L2]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4","source_pages":[4,5],"source_pdf_pages":[22,23]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-Z2"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-Z2</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-Z2 — Full Second Order Arithmetic"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d77f54c9499e3bba\" href=\"?note=d77f54c9499e3bba\" title=\"62-df-basic-axioms\">62-df-basic-axioms</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f8dc93fa5380b9d2\" href=\"?note=f8dc93fa5380b9d2\" title=\"62-df-set-induction\">62-df-set-induction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e7a06a0db4bcea18\" href=\"?note=e7a06a0db4bcea18\" title=\"62-df-Comprehension\">62-df-Comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definition I.2.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>4</span><span>5</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>22</span><span>23</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>基本公理见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d77f54c9499e3bba\" href=\"?note=d77f54c9499e3bba\" title=\"62-df-basic-axioms\">62-df-basic-axioms</a>，集合归纳见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f8dc93fa5380b9d2\" href=\"?note=f8dc93fa5380b9d2\" title=\"62-df-set-induction\">62-df-set-induction</a>，完整公式类和理解模式见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"4c6d2d9f1999915f\" href=\"?note=4c6d2d9f1999915f\" title=\"62-df-L2\">62-df-L2</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e7a06a0db4bcea18\" href=\"?note=e7a06a0db4bcea18\" title=\"62-df-Comprehension\">62-df-Comprehension</a>。</p>\n<p>上游接口为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\">\\(\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Z2}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm Z_2\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\{\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}Z2}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm Z_2\\coloneqq\\mathrm Q_2\\cup\\{\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}\\}\\cup\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_2}^{2}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应书中八条基本公理、单个集合归纳公理、完整理解模式。完整公式归纳是其推论：先由理解形成公式的真值集合，再应用集合归纳。“完整理解”不强迫一般模型的集合域等于元理论中的全幂集。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definition I.2.4；纸面页 4, 5；PDF 页 22, 23。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-basic-axioms","status":"resolved","id":"d77f54c9499e3bba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-basic-axioms]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-set-inductio